## 2. What This Is

A personal portfolio that is becoming **PortfolioOS**: an automation-first content
management and publishing platform for professionals. The current repo is the
product prototype and the personal dogfooding workspace simultaneously.

The prototype demonstrates:
- Structured content in 4 JSON files
- A password-gated admin CMS (single HTML page, 682 lines)
- GitHub Contents API publishing (PUT/commit direct to main)
- LocalStorage draft persistence
- 7 interactive product demonstration apps
- 2 gamified flagship case studies
- "The Product Memo" design language

The startup vision: turn this single-owner workflow into a hosted multi-user SaaS.
Full vision in PRODUCT_VISION_AND_ROADMAP.md.

