## 5. Design Language — "The Product Memo"

Locked as of Session 8. Do not change without explicit instruction.

### Typography
- **Display/editorial:** Newsreader (serif, italic for emphasis)
- **Body/UI:** Inter (replaces old Hanken Grotesk)
- **Mono:** system monospace for codes, figcaps, toasts

### Color palette — CSS variables
- `--paper` — warm off-white (editorial pages background)
- `--clay` — terracotta/rust (accent, CTAs, hover states, underline draw-ins)
- `--line` — mid-grey (borders, dotted leaders)
- `--ink` — near-black (body text)
- `--canvas` — light grey (app page background)
- Navy/blue system — case study and app pages only

### Key classes / patterns
- `.figcap` — mono tick + uppercase caption below images
- `.cta-band` — dark pre-footer strip with clay CTA
- `.colophon` — small typeset line at bottom of Work page
- `body::before` — SVG paper grain at 2.5% opacity (fixed, z-index:1; nav at z-index:10)
- `::selection` — clay background
- `@view-transition { navigation: auto }` — page transitions
- `prefers-reduced-motion` — kills all transitions + animations

### Interaction patterns
- Underline draw-in: `::after` `width: 0 → 100%` on hover (nav links, footer links)
- Dotted leaders: `.work-row` flex with `::after` dotted border-bottom filling space
- Count-up: IntersectionObserver + `data-target` on `.count-num` spans
- Line-by-line hero reveal: `<span class="line"><span>…</span></span>` with `line-rise` keyframe
- Email copy toast: "COPIED — NOW WRITE THE HARD PROBLEM" (3s, mono)

### Page structure (all 4 editorial pages)
- Nav: Work · Labs · About · Contact
- Hero + stat strip
- Content sections
- CTA dark band
- Footer: 4-col grid (Navigate · Case Studies · Elsewhere + brand tagline), collapses at 760px

