## 11. Key Technical Guardrails

- `labs-data.js` is AUTO-GENERATED from `labs.json`. If you edit labs.json, regenerate:
  ```
  python3 -c "import json;d=json.load(open('labs.json'));open('js/labs-data.js','w').write('window.LABS_SEED = '+json.dumps(d,indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)+';\n')"
  ```
- Hash-based router in labs: `#/`, `#/lab/<id>`, `#/product/<labId>/<prodId>`
- Cache-bust all JS/CSS refs with `?v=N` after changes (browser caches aggressively with python http.server)
- `gh` CLI is NOT installed. Publishing = git push OR admin CMS (GitHub Contents API).
- GitHub token location: macOS Keychain as `atlassian-jira-token`
- Grain overlay: `body::before` is `position:fixed, z-index:1`. Nav is `z-index:10`. Keep this order.
- `prefers-reduced-motion` must disable ALL animations when added.

