## 12. Decisions Made (do not relitigate)

| Decision | Detail |
|---|---|
| Design language | "The Product Memo" — Inter + Newsreader, clay/paper tokens |
| Case study structure | Option B: one scrolling page per flagship, 7 stages |
| Discipline tags | Link artifacts back to discipline labs |
| Flagship scope | 2 flagships (AI Collections + LOS), 6 discipline labs below |
| Admin v2 architecture | Phase A–F as described above |
| Supabase for auth/drafts | Replacing localStorage + plaintext password |
| Admin publish target | Directly to main (no PR/branch overhead) |

